    "text": "loudounnow.com\nwebsite\nPurcellville\nPurcellville Council Minority Reacts to Strategic Planning\nBy Hanna Pampaloni,\n13 hours agoPurcellville Town Council members who did not attend Saturday’s strategic planning retreat on Tuesday raised concerns about the priorities adopted during the six-hour session. The meeting was attended by Mayor Christopher Bertaut and councilmembers Carol Luke and Susan Khalil. Vice Mayor Ben Nett also attended, but left the meeting...",
